# The ruling: "Tragedy Feaster's infusion ability will trigger regardless of whether you've gained life this turn. As the ability resolves, it will check." Bot1 gains no life before its end
# step, so the ability triggers and goes on the stack; in response Bot1 casts Lightning Helix (gaining 3), and the ability resolves sacrificing nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Tragedy Feaster
Lightning Helix
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tragedy Feaster.Cast
[T1 Bot1.End]
? Stack = Tragedy Feaster
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Helix.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Upkeep]

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Bot1.Life = 23
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Tragedy Feaster
